bpf_helper_defs-7.2.7.h.gz
    The bpf_helper_defs.h that UPSTREAM scripts/bpf_doc.py generated from that bpf.h, taken
    from tools/bpf/resolve_btfids/libbpf/ of a full linux-runink 7.2.7-zen1-1 build made
    before bpfdoc existed (2026-09-24; bpftool's bootstrap copy was the same file). It is the
    oracle: no Python was run to produce or check it for this change. Uncompressed sha256:
    05e718b9297813159527482b0174fcb5a3e705a4bea836cd46af206857fd3697

When the kernel pin moves: replace both files with the new kernel's bpf.h and the header
generated from it by a known-good build (or by libbpf's own committed bpf_helper_defs.h if its
bpf.h is byte-identical), rename them, update main_test.go, and port any change in the new
scripts/bpf_doc.py's --header path to main.go.
